# Spec / TDD / chips

- Formal work: Spec → red behavioral test → green minimal code → refactor → docs.
- Execute **one chip** at a time from the active card. Each chip names files, the failing test first, and `Verify:` with expected outcome.
- No mocks (ADR 0003): simulators, local protocol servers, or recorded fixtures only.
- Inject ManualClock / injectable clocks — no wall-time sleeps.
- Every feature needs at least one negative test a naive implementation would fail.
- Do not check a DoD or chip box without running its Verify command.
